    "aliases_milestones": "Candidate asserts retained old placements resolve to genuine scenes, visible alias pointers route to a scene included in its canonical owner refs, owner milestone partition precedence, and explicit shadowing. Full-source logic compares public feature plus course-only scene union to native baseline scene IDs.",
